VERSIONS:

SIGLISTR v 0.2 accounts for non-contiguous SIG numbers, that is, you
may have SIG 1, SIG 2, SIG 4 ... without a SIG 3.  See paragraph 6
above.

SIGLISTR v 0.1 works fine on my Starnet system.
